## Claude Code per-machine settings
#  settings.json is shared; settings.local.json is this machine's own
#  permission allowlist and was tracked by mistake. It accumulates
#  entries that name one machine's paths and one session's ids, so it
#  showed as modified on every status for everybody.
.claude/settings.local.json

#  The preview harness builds into its own folder and is regenerated on
#  demand (scripts/preview/README.md). The screenshots taken from it are
#  artefacts of a moment, not of the repository.
scripts/preview/out/
.preview/
